1
00:00:00,963 --> 00:00:04,133
(sighs heavily)

2
00:00:07,737 --> 00:00:09,437
(Amy:)You did it.

3
00:00:09,438 --> 00:00:11,638
(Amy:)Do you feel okay?

4
00:00:12,675 --> 00:00:14,845
(Sheldon:)Actually, yes.

5
00:00:16,045 --> 00:00:17,475
(Howard:)I do.

6
00:00:18,381 --> 00:00:20,181
(Amy:)Well, I'm proud of you.

7
00:00:20,182 --> 00:00:22,382
Oh. Thanks.

8
00:00:36,865 --> 00:00:40,605
(Sheldon:)I'm glad I told you
about the storage unit.

9
00:00:40,602 --> 00:00:42,502
(Amy:)Well, I feel closer to you now.

10
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:45,327
(Sheldon:)Oh, I feel closer to you, too.

11
00:00:45,326 --> 00:00:46,596
(Amy:)You know,

12
00:00:46,594 --> 00:00:50,234
(Sheldon:)it's still a couple
of hours until my bedtime.

13
00:00:57,004 --> 00:00:59,634
(Amy:)What did you have in mind?

14
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:02,070
(Sheldon:)You look amazing.

15
00:01:05,546 --> 00:01:10,116
(Penny:)I mean,
this resolution is remarkable.

16
00:01:11,052 --> 00:01:14,592
(Amy(on Skype):)I really had to go home
for this?

17
00:01:14,589 --> 00:01:18,929
(Sheldon:)Yes, but it's like
you're right here in the room.

18
00:01:18,926 --> 00:01:22,026
(Amy:)And yet, I'm not.

19
00:01:22,029 --> 00:01:25,599
(Sheldon:)But I feel like I could
reach out and touch you.

20
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,770
(Amy:)And yet, you can't.

21
00:01:29,570 --> 00:01:31,440
I know!

